TO","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7222603,"initDialog":722260301,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[20452],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Inazuma_72226/Q7222603","priority":5,"questId":72226,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":722260301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":2916834018,"text":"Thanks so much!","nextNodeIds":[722260302]},{"nodeId":722260302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":423528642,"text":"The Perch seems to be in a good state. I'm sure the ceremony will go well this time!","nextNodeIds":[722260303,722260304]},{"nodeId":722260303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1949813330,"text":"Easy-peasy.","nextNodeIds":[722260305]},{"nodeId":722260304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4150238514,"text":"It was pretty dicey.","nextNodeIds":[722260305]},{"nodeId":722260305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2327817042,"text":"Hehe. We're pretty seasoned travelers, after all!","nextNodeIds":[722260306]},{"nodeId":722260306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":2913785802,"text":"#Actually, {NICKNAME}, where are you from?","nextNodeIds":[722260307]},{"nodeId":722260307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":1872489962,"text":"The people who came before talked about places called Inazuma and Narukami Island. Are you from Inazuma?","nextNodeIds":[722260308,722260312]},{"nodeId":722260308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":805477218,"text":"If you're speaking relatively...","nextNodeIds":[722260309]},{"nodeId":722260309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2104391882,"text":"Huh, that's right, we did come from Narukami Island, didn't we... Wait a moment!","nextNodeIds":[722260310]},{"nodeId":722260310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2845582674,"text":"Paimon's almost forgotten that we're here for the Maushiro!","nextNodeIds":[722260312]},{"nodeId":722260311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4100459706,"text":"We're from a very, very distant place...","nextNodeIds":[722260312]},{"nodeId":722260312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1649609946,"text":"That's true...","nextNodeIds":[722260313]},{"nodeId":722260313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":230207922,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[722260314]},{"nodeId":722260314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":322350034,"text":"Wow! You even climbed on top of a dragon?","nextNodeIds":[722260315,722260316]},{"nodeId":722260315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3991066802,"text":"Well, it was a pretty uncomfortable affair.","nextNodeIds":[722260317]},{"nodeId":722260316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3673615826,"text":"It was alright.","nextNodeIds":[722260317]},{"nodeId":722260317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":514600946,"text":"That's so awesome...","nextNodeIds":[722260318]},{"nodeId":722260318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2394748498,"text":"The world's a big place, kiddo!","nextNodeIds":[722260319]},{"nodeId":722260319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":3389596650,"text":"I never knew that there were so many places outside the Sea of Fog. If I leave someday, I'd love to see all of them!","nextNodeIds":[722260320]},{"nodeId":722260320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":2733879738,"text":"They always tell us that our souls will become lost if we leave the fog, and that the fog protects us from the darkness outside.","nextNodeIds":[722260321]},{"nodeId":722260321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":68109586,"text":"But I've met quite a few people from the outside. That's why I know that the Sea of Silence must be inhabited somehow.","nextNodeIds":[722260322]},{"nodeId":722260322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2588993474,"text":"You can come with us if you have the chance.","nextNodeIds":[722260323]},{"nodeId":722260323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":1293394218,"text":"Alright! It's a deal, then!","nextNodeIds":[722260324]},{"nodeId":722260324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":206301498,"text":"You two go ahead first!","nextNodeIds":[722260325]},{"nodeId":722260325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2288588050,"text":"Once the ceremony's over, let's explore the world outside Tsurumi Island together!","nextNodeIds":[722260326]},{"nodeId":722260326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20452,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":1173151978,"text":"Sure!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7222602_finish"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["72167","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_INC_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3111","0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_WEATHER_GADGET"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP